import lib/cadkernel/nurbs2.dl
set points to a list containing (the cad zero vector2)
append (a cad vector2 with x 1.0 and y 2.0) to points
set empty to an empty list of a 64 bit floating-point number
set weights to a list containing (1.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number)
append (1.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) to weights
set result to the cad nurbs curve2 of degree 1 with controls points, knots empty and weights weights
